00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Disqualified?!</font>

32
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Danger!</font>

33
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Moving
Ahead of
Schedule!</font>

34
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Main Tournament</font>

35
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:44,540
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">with Troubles!</font>

36
00:01:55,170 --> 00:01:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

37
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

38
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that fox kid can fight like this...</font>

39
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was awesome!</font>

40
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done!</font>

41
00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a great fight!</font>

42
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

43
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he still has the energy
to run around...</font>

44
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man... He's got crazy stamina that guy...</font>

45
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

46
00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He keeps getting stronger...</font>

47
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it... that kid.</font>

48
00:02:50,270 --> 00:02:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! He's on the right track!</font>

49
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he's a little cute...</font>

50
00:02:57,570 --> 00:02:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something about it...</font>

51
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm envious of you...</font>

52
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watching your battle makes me think
that I have to work really hard too...</font>

53
00:03:06,370 --> 00:03:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's amazing, you know?</font>

54
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:17,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won. Is it for real?</font>

55
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:21,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought he was the same as me,
in the not going anywhere class...</font>

56
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not going anywhere?</font>

57
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now people are squealing...</font>

58
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like he's part of the group
that's going somewhere.</font>

59
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I couldn't beat him...</font>

60
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is really bad.
It kinda depresses me...</font>

61
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:38,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To retain himself and draw out
the Chakras of the Nine-Tailed Fox...</font>

62
00:03:38,530 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... Most of the Leaf Village people
here are surprised.</font>

63
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

64
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did he learn to control the strength
of Nine-Tailed Fox to that extent?</font>

65
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even a bird who gets caught,
once it learns how,</font>

66
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will open the lid of its basket
with its own beak.</font>

67
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't give up, for he wants to
fly freely in the sky again.</font>

68
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time you lost!</font>

69
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...</font>

70
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay, there's no damage
to his internal organs.</font>

71
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like his Chakra
is almost used up.</font>

72
00:04:43,470 --> 00:04:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are not the only one special.</font>

73
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you act against
your fate that much?!</font>

74
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I was called a failure...</font>

75
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who become Hokage
are born to that fate.</font>

76
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?!</font>

77
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hyuga-sama!</font>

78
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:14,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry but...
Could you step out for a moment?</font>

79
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:17,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

80
00:05:17,670 --> 00:05:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't take long.</font>

81
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes.</font>

82
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you need from me?</font>

83
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day...</font>

84
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to tell you the truth...
about that day.</font>

85
00:05:41,730 --> 00:05:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day...?</font>

86
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, I intended to die!</font>

87
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you talking about?!</font>

88
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day my father...</font>

89
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was killed
as your body double!</font>

90
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:37,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The truth of that day... is here.</font>

91
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're probably only excuses made
at the convenience of the head family.</font>

92
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person you are now...
should be able to understand.</font>

93
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This writing...!</font>

94
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji... I only have a little time left.</font>

95
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to use that limited time
to convey something to you...</font>

96
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Convey something to me?</font>

97
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:21,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The head of the Shinobi from the
Land of Lightning,</font>

98
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who was trying to kidnap Hinata-sama,
was killed by Hiashi-sama...</font>

99
00:07:26,090 --> 00:07:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Land of Lightning didn't
acknowledge the abduction of Hinata-sama,</font>

100
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">made only the killing
of the head Shinobi a problem,</font>

101
00:07:34,050 --> 00:07:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and made unreasonable demands.</font>

102
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

103
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With my one life,
the village can be saved...</font>

104
00:07:46,230 --> 00:07:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Hiashi. Don't be so hasty!</font>

105
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hyuga's Kekkei Genkai
is an important strength of this land.</font>

106
00:07:56,660 --> 00:08:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is the duty of the head family
to protect it forever...</font>

107
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, for the sake of that duty...</font>

108
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we involve our land
in a desperate war...!</font>

109
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:10,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that!
That's why...</font>

110
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that why
we have branch families?</font>

111
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hizashi's corpse...
We'll hand it over as your body double.</font>

112
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hizashi too...
understands the situation.</font>

113
00:08:32,570 --> 00:08:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, what they want is
the secret of the power of the Byakugan.</font>

114
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The point in time that
Hizashi becomes a corpse,</font>

115
00:08:41,290 --> 00:08:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that power will be sealed.</font>

116
00:08:44,290 --> 00:08:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't believe that the Land of Lightning
will consent to that.</font>

117
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's their true intent,</font>

118
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the condition made by Lightning is to
"Hand over Hyuga Hiashi's dead body."</font>

119
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We pretend that we agreed
to their terms,</font>

120
00:09:00,890 --> 00:09:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and hand Hizashi,
who is identical to you, over...</font>

121
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and they can't pursue it
any further than that.</font>

122
00:09:07,810 --> 00:09:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

123
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:16,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hiashi... The time has come...</font>

124
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your predecessors have done the same
to protect the power of Hyuga clan.</font>

125
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:26,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even siblings...
have the heart to write each other off.</font>

126
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the fate of the head family.</font>

127
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this... is the destiny of
ones born into Hyuga!</font>

128
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:44,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where has Hiashi-sama,
who is always bullish, go?</font>

129
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The scale of this issue is different
from the ones in the past!</font>

130
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that easy...</font>

131
00:10:00,030 --> 00:10:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hizashi... you...</font>

132
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... let me go.</font>

133
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... You... have Neji.</font>

134
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you choose death...
for the head family?!</font>

135
00:10:21,470 --> 00:10:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not so!</font>

136
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have been resenting
the head family.</font>

137
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To tell the truth
even now I'm bitter.</font>

138
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why...</font>

139
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to die protecting you as
"my brother," not as the head family.</font>

140
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time I've had
the freedom to choose.</font>

141
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've only shown Neji my ugly side.</font>

142
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, now I've come here
and finally know my own intentions.</font>

143
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So please tell Neji...</font>

144
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I wasn't killed to protect
the head family...</font>

145
00:11:09,350 --> 00:11:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to protect my siblings,
family and the land...</font>

146
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by my own will I chose death!</font>

147
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-To choose death...
you call that freedom...?</font>

148
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san...</font>

149
00:11:34,340 --> 00:11:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once, just this once,
I wanted to defy the fate of Hyuga.</font>

150
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to choose my own fate.</font>

151
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all.</font>

152
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:53,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Overcome your own fate, Neji...</font>

153
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fate is something you work out
with your own hands.</font>

154
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...</font>

155
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... the truth!</font>

156
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry!</font>

157
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... raise your head.</font>

158
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...</font>

159
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if a person's destiny is
only floating like a cloud in a fixed current...</font>

160
00:12:42,610 --> 00:12:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or is a person able to ride
on the current that he chooses.</font>

161
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't understand it well yet.</font>

162
00:12:50,370 --> 00:12:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whichever, the end point
might still be the same...</font>

163
00:12:54,540 --> 00:12:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just, when the choice is the latter...</font>

164
00:12:57,130 --> 00:12:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">people turn toward the goal of
living and work hard toward it.</font>

165
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And those who hold that
are really strong.</font>

166
00:13:04,090 --> 00:13:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like I finally understand,
through this battle...</font>

167
00:13:09,050 --> 00:13:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... father...</font>

168
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have only one goal...</font>

169
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:18,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to become stronger,
so I won't lose to anyone.</font>

170
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how I feel now.</font>

171
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father... I see many birds flying.
And they seem to be enjoying themselves.</font>

172
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's buzzing.</font>

173
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because it was a good battle...</font>

174
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:48,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly, there's that too, but...</font>

175
00:13:50,050 --> 00:13:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's likely that, for the curious heads
of Ninja and the feudal lords,</font>

176
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is no match they look forward to
more than this next match.</font>

177
