a</font></font></b></font>

179
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, it seems that
he wasn't seen at the opening ceremony...</font>

180
00:14:08,070 --> 00:14:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's arrived here already, hasn't he?</font>

181
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's been no news of Sasuke.</font>

182
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there's the issue of Orochimaru.</font>

183
00:14:20,380 --> 00:14:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before everyone starts to make noise,
we should disqualify him...</font>

184
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:30,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!
Hurry up and start the next match!</font>

185
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:32,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long are you going to
make us wait!</font>

186
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:33,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before night falls!</font>

187
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what's going on
with the next match?</font>

188
00:14:38,810 --> 00:14:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Sasuke-kun here?</font>

189
00:14:42,270 --> 00:14:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

190
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy...
What in the world is he doing?!</font>

191
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he planning
not to show up?</font>

192
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wise man never courts danger...</font>

193
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wise judgment... is it?</font>

194
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

195
00:15:03,210 --> 00:15:06,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll definitely come!</font>

196
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But seriously, what is he doing?</font>

197
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep this up and he...
he'll be disqualified.</font>

198
00:15:27,690 --> 00:15:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no choice...</font>

199
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is... disqualified.</font>

200
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:34,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

201
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke is... disqualified?</font>

202
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has to be done.</font>

203
00:15:43,330 --> 00:15:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world are
we going to do?</font>

204
00:15:45,210 --> 00:15:47,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that guy doesn't show up,
our plan of strategy...</font>

205
00:15:48,090 --> 00:15:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good...</font>

206
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could he have...?</font>

207
00:15:56,970 --> 00:15:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you going, Gaara?</font>

208
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to confirm my existence...</font>

209
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:06,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn that Gaara...</font>

210
00:16:06,980 --> 00:16:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he really killed him...</font>

211
00:16:19,410 --> 00:16:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke one more time...</font>

212
00:16:24,830 --> 00:16:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

213
00:16:26,540 --> 00:16:29,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's obvious that you're there
standing with the thirst for blood.</font>

214
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:31,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you come out?</font>

215
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's you...</font>

216
00:16:47,230 --> 00:16:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-dono...</font>

217
00:16:48,770 --> 00:16:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to consider waiting a little bit
for Uchiha Sasuke's disqualification.</font>

218
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand your point, but...</font>

219
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:59,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how excellent the Shinobi,</font>

220
00:16:59,160 --> 00:17:02,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to make light of time is not
a qualification for Chunin.</font>

221
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's no clear reason to satisfy</font>

222
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the heads of Shinobi and feudal lords
who are here,</font>

223
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no reason to wait for him!</font>

224
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:13,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

225
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, there is a sufficient reason.</font>

226
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Including myself...</font>

227
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">most of the heads of Shinobi and
feudal lords that are here...</font>

228
00:17:23,810 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">came here because
they want to see the next match.</font>

229
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

230
00:17:32,110 --> 00:17:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the remaining survivor
of the "Uchiha."</font>

231
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Land of the Wind too, absolutely,
is hoping for a bout with our Gaara.</font>

232
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama...</font>

233
00:17:44,710 --> 00:17:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no guarantee that
Sasuke will come but...</font>

234
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:50,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right then...</font>

235
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We shall specially postpone
this match and wait.</font>

236
00:17:58,260 --> 00:18:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama! Really...</font>

237
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inform so to the Proctor!</font>

238
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes.</font>

239
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

240
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's rare for you to insist like that,
Kazekage-dono.</font>

241
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

242
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To show off the Shinobi's qualities
of our village to the feudal lords...</font>

243
00:18:19,990 --> 00:18:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no better opponent
than an Uchiha.</font>

244
00:18:23,490 --> 00:18:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a chance for us as well.</font>

245
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, what happened to the match?!</font>

246
00:18:29,330 --> 00:18:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Uchiha?!</font>

247
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand...</font>

248
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone! The candidate for the
next battle has not arrived here!</font>

249
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll briefly postpone this battle
and start the following battle ahead of it.</font>

250
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is he doing... that Sasuke?</font>

251
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Great, so Sasuke-kun didn't get disqualified!</font>

252
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good...</font>

253
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! That means my match
is one match closer!</font>

254
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, on to the next pair!</font>

255
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro and Aburame Shino!
Come down!</font>

256
00:19:20,630 --> 00:19:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My match... doesn't matter at all.</font>

257
00:19:26,970 --> 00:19:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly...</font>

258
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd rather not expose the Mechanism
of Crow to the enemy before the plan...</font>

259
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Proctor!</font>

260
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I abstain!</font>

261
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

262
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I abstain!
Please advance the matches!</font>

263
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Due to Kankuro's abstention,
Aburame Shino wins by default!</font>

264
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that all about?!</font>

265
00:20:06,470 --> 00:20:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have a proper match!</font>

266
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...?</font>

267
00:20:24,410 --> 00:20:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my turn, isn't it?</font>

268
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that you're really fired up.</font>

269
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go to the next match.</font>

270
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! The last one, come down!</font>

271
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! What are you doing,
frivolously building things up?</font>

272
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, why does only
my match have to be modified?</font>

273
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nara Shikamaru! You!</font>

274
00:20:47,930 --> 00:20:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...
If it's like this I'll abstain too...</font>

275
00:20:51,310 --> 00:20:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon! Shikamaru, fight hard!</font>

276
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn that Naruto...</font>

277
